# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

# Distribution / packaging
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
Berikut adalah `.gitignore` komprehensif yang dirancang khusus untuk proyek Python, sudah mencakup folder virtual environment dan cache yang Anda sebutkan:

```gitignore
# Virtual Environment
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/

# Python Cache & Bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Testing & Coverage
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.noserc
nosetests.xml

# Environment Variables & Secrets
.env
.env.local
*.pem

# IDE & Editor Settings
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Distribution / Packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.egg

debug_log.txt

/chroma_db/*/
